00:33:50.744 --> 00:33:53.538
As we got to meet more and more people of this country 

00:33:53.538 --> 00:33:55.538
We couldn't stop ourselves from wondering:

00:33:55.538 --> 00:33:57.538
How people in the darkest and most challenging of times

00:33:57.538 --> 00:34:00.669
somehow found the strengths and the kindness

00:34:00.669 --> 00:34:02.504
to be the most giving

00:34:02.504 --> 00:34:05.465
In many ways, that is what I've seen in a lot of countries struggling

00:34:05.465 --> 00:34:08.968
That somehow, in the most difficult of times,

00:34:08.968 --> 00:34:10.968
our humanity also comes out.

00:34:10.968 --> 00:34:15.932
Our deep desire for connection, love and care really does blossom where we're left with so little.

00:34:15.932 --> 00:34:20.895
And really, in the moments where we all feel fear or disconnected from the world

00:34:20.895 --> 00:34:26.859
Let's remember and take inspiration from the kindness and camaraderie displayed before us.

